{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/\u5934\u50cf4.png?t=1749604806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SETTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sun Wukong, Nezha, and Yang Jian, three legendary Chinese mythological characters, face their destined opponents in life, whether they are gods or demons, and confront them head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/Longmen01.png?t=1749604806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel style: Exquisite Q-version pixel painting style, awakening memories in the mind with a new style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike gameplay: With each new game, the map room is randomly generated: the positions of enemies, treasure chests, and events change, making every experience full of freshness for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich skills: The game has many skills, but unlike many games, skills are randomly assigned to characters. Tell a secret: If only one character is selected, all those skills will only be assigned to one character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/Longmen05.png?t=1749604806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fighter system of the game is not complicated at all, it is a relatively simple turn based card battle. No need to build, randomly select cards according to their type and level, easily tackle various challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773810/extras/Longmen03.png?t=1749604806\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773810?t=1749604806","background_raw":"https://store.aka